- If information is pending or unverified (e.g., exact dates of past corporate roles, canonical Nextwaves domain), document it in `roadmap.md` and `docs/DEVELOPER_GUIDE.md` under pending content.

## 8. SEO, Metadata & Animations Restrictions (Phase 6 Only)
- Do not add complex animations, scroll triggers, heavy canvas effects, or complete JSON-LD schemas during Phases 1–5.
- Keep early phases focused on structural integrity, semantic markup, and responsive design.
- Phase 6 is dedicated to metadata, Open Graph, canonical links, structured data (JSON-LD), performance tuning, and accessible micro-animations (with `prefers-reduced-motion` support).

## 9. Documentation Discipline
- Maintain `roadmap.md`, `docs/CHANGELOG.md`, and `docs/DEVELOPER_GUIDE.md` alongside code changes.
- Never write inaccurate status reports or fabricated test results.
- Document every file created or modified.
